#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:8
msgid "dm-multipath interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `dm-multipath` interface allows snaps to manage and access device-mapper "
"multipath maps by communicating with the multipathd daemon. It is intended "
"for storage orchestration software that needs to list, create, reload and "
"remove multipath devices and react to path state changes. Direct "
"unrestricted access to arbitrary raw block devices is not granted; normal "
"snap device cgroup mediation still applies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"For further details on interfaces, see {ref}`How to connect interfaces "
"<explanation-interfaces-all-about-interfaces>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:14
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:16
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:25
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:27
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/dm-multipath-interface.md:20
msgid ""
"This interface controls a resource shared by the whole system. Snaps that "
"use it can be installed as parallel instances, but every instance acts on "
"the same system resource and snapd does not coordinate between them. Make "
"sure each instance manages different resources, or run only one instance at "
"a time. See {ref}`Snaps that are unsupported as parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-shared-resources>` for details.."
msgstr ""

